ated monitoring.","feed":{"published_epoch":1794465614.4696918,"interval_seconds":60,"next_update_epoch":1794465674.4696918},"model_note":"Gen 7.1 standard (71s-32) is Gen 7 standard with policy net v4.1 in place of v4; nothing else differs. Gen 7 standard (7s-32) is Gen 6 fast (6-32: same bidder, lead net, hand-fit scorer, layouts and 32 samples) with the gen7 engine (bridge_harness/gen7.py) and policy net v4: layouts weighted by the play so far from trick 7, exact ties broken by the net, and at tricks 3 to 6 a tree search over the net's likeliest cards that re-values the cards the search rates within 0.25 tricks of its best (trust 0.3, stake rule at 0.5 IMPs, at most 3 tricks, 8 layouts). Settings are in the bot's `gen7` block. Every other bot is unchanged from the source run. docs/gen7_alpha_2026-11-11.md has the details.","source_cohort_overlap":false,"allocation":{"71s-32~6-32":1,"71s-32~7s-32":2},"statistics_policy":{},"collection":{"updated_epoch":1794465377.4752057,"running":false,"workers":4,"total_completed":0,"training_only_completed":0},"difference_views":{"0":{"groups":{}},"100":{"groups":{}},"500":{"groups":{}},"1000":{"groups":{}}},"difference_definition":{"unit":"IMPs per board, candidate minus opponent","play":"Common Gen6-bidder auction result","total":"Native partnership-bidder auction result","bidding":"Native minus common on the same board; includes auction/play interaction","uncertainty":"Student-t intervals on paired per-board differences; exploratory, unadjusted for repeated monitoring"}}
